WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.997
Practise safe, respectful communication and information privacy

00:00:04.867 --> 00:00:10.092
Communication: sharing messages or ideas with other people. Radio: a system that

00:00:10.092 --> 00:00:12.269
broadcasts sound over a distance.

00:00:13.117 --> 00:00:19.321
Mobile phone: a device that can carry calls and messages. Privacy: keeping personal

00:00:19.321 --> 00:00:24.093
information secure from unwanted access. Digital etiquette: polite and considerate

00:00:24.093 --> 00:00:26.002
behaviour when communicating online.

00:00:26.867 --> 00:00:30.984
Prepare a two-column chart of benefits and risks of using a mobile phone.
